$$
a = 4,\quad b = 4,\quad c = 224
$$

We verify this solution satisfies the original equation:

$$
abc - ab - bc - ca + a + b + c = 4 \cdot 4 \cdot 224 - (4 \cdot 4 + 4 \cdot 224 + 224 \cdot 4) + (4 + 4 + 224)
$$

