$$

At $ z = 1 $:

$$
-\frac{2(1)}{(1 + 1)^2} = -\frac{2}{4} = -\frac{1}{2}
$$

So,

$$
\text{Res}_{z=1} f(z) = -\frac{1}{2}
$$

