- Center: $ 1 \cdot 6 \cdot 2.58496 = 15.5098 $

Total sum:

$$
38.039 + 96 + 69.658 + 15.5098 = 219.2068
$$

Then:

$$
r = \frac{219.2068}{108} \approx 2.03
$$

