$$
$$
\Rightarrow -3x + 6 - 4y + 8 + 5z - 5 = 0 \Rightarrow -3x - 4y + 5z + 9 = 0
$$

So the plane equation is:
$$
-3x - 4y + 5z + 9 = 0 \quad \text{or} \quad 3x + 4y - 5z - 9 = 0
$$

---

### Step 4: Compute the distance from the origin to the plane

The standard form of the plane is:
$$
3x + 4y - 5z - 9 = 0
$$

The distance from the origin $ (0,0,0) $ to the plane is:
$$
