\sum_{k=0}^\infty (-1)^{k+1} \cdot \frac{k + 1}{k + 3} x^k
$$

This matches **Option J**:

> J. $ \sum_{k=0}^\infty \left( (-1)^{k+1} \cdot \frac{k+1}{k+3} \right) x^k $

