$$
f(x) = n \quad \Rightarrow \quad n \leq \frac{x}{2} < n + 1 \quad \Rightarrow \quad 2n \leq x < 2n + 2
$$

Thus, the preimage of an integer $ n $ under $ f $ is the interval $ [2n, 2n + 2) $.

