$$

So the time required is approximately:

$$
\boxed{19.76}
$$

---

### ✅ Final Answers:

(a) $\boxed{10000 \cdot 0.89^t}$  
(b) $\boxed{4969.81}$  
(c) $\boxed{19.76}$"
