$$
\int x \cdot \arctan(2x)^2 \, dx = \frac{x^2}{2} [\arctan(2x)]^2 - \int \frac{x^2}{2} \cdot \frac{4 \arctan(2x)}{1 + 4x^2} \, dx
$$

