\Rightarrow 2c_i \leq 2c_{i+1} + 1
\Rightarrow c_i \leq c_{i+1} + 0.5
$$

Since $ c_i $ and $ c_{i+1} $ are integers, this implies $ c_i \leq c_{i+1} $, so the sequence $ c_1, c_2, \ldots, c_{10} $ must be **non-decreasing**.

