$$
\hat{p} = \frac{x}{n} = \frac{46}{63} \approx 0.73015873
$$

The standard error (SE) under the null hypothesis is:

$$
SE = \sqrt{\frac{p_0(1 - p_0)}{n}} = \sqrt{\frac{0.5 \cdot 0.5}{63}} = \sqrt{\frac{0.25}{63}} \approx 0.06299
$$

