$$
15 + \sqrt{k} \approx 28.86 \Rightarrow \sqrt{k} \approx 13.86 \Rightarrow k \approx 192.13
$$

Among the given options, the closest value of $ k $ to 192.13 is **211**, which corresponds to option **J**:

$$
\sqrt{15 + \sqrt{211}} \approx \sqrt{15 + 14.526} = \sqrt{29.526} \approx 5.434
$$

This is the **closest** option to the computed spectral radius $ \approx 5.3723 $.

